  "$P(-)={@0}\\cdot {@1}+{@2}\\cdot {@3}={@4}$. Bayesova veta: $P(\\bar{D}\\mid -)=\\frac{{@5}}{{@6}}\\approx {@7}$.": "$P(-)={@0}\\cdot {@1}+{@2}\\cdot {@3}={@4}$. 베이즈 정리: $P(\\bar{D}\\mid -)=\\frac{{@5}}{{@6}}\\approx {@7}$.",
  "$P(A)={@0}$, $P(B)={@1}$ a $P(A\\cap B)={@2}$": "$P(A)={@0}$, $P(B)={@1}$, $P(A\\cap B)={@2}$",
  "$P(A)\\,P(B)={@0}\\cdot {@1}={@2}=P(A\\cap B)$, javy sú <strong>nezávislé</strong>.": "$P(A)\\,P(B)={@0}\\cdot {@1}={@2}=P(A\\cap B)$이므로 두 사건은 <strong>독립</strong>이에요.",
