  "$P(|\\bar{X}_n-\\mu|\\ge\\varepsilon)\\le\\frac{\\sigma^2}{n\\varepsilon^2}=\\frac{{@0}}{n\\cdot {@1}}$. Stačí $\\frac{{@2}}{{@3}\\,n}\\le {@4}$, teda $n\\ge {@5}$.": "$P(|\\bar{X}_n-\\mu|\\ge\\varepsilon)\\le\\frac{\\sigma^2}{n\\varepsilon^2}=\\frac{{@0}}{n\\cdot {@1}}$. $\\frac{{@2}}{{@3}\\,n}\\le {@4}$이면 충분하므로 $n\\ge {@5}$예요.",
  "$R^2=1-SSE/SST$ je podiel vysvetlenej variability.": "$R^2=1-SSE/SST$는 설명된 변동의 비율이에요.",
