  "$\\hat{p}=\\frac{{@0}}{{@1}}={@2}$, $\\sqrt{\\frac{\\hat{p}(1-\\hat{p})}{n}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{{@3}\\cdot {@4}}{{@5}}}\\approx {@6}$, polovičná šírka ${@7}\\cdot {@8}\\approx {@9}$. Interval: $({@10};\\ {@11})$.": "$\\hat{p}=\\frac{{@0}}{{@1}}={@2}$, $\\sqrt{\\frac{\\hat{p}(1-\\hat{p})}{n}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{{@3}\\cdot {@4}}{{@5}}}\\approx {@6}$, 반폭은 ${@7}\\cdot {@8}\\approx {@9}$. 구간: $({@10};\\ {@11})$.",
  "$\\int_0^{{@0}}c\\,{@1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x=c\\left[\\frac{x^{{@2}}}{{@3}}\\right]_0^{{@4}}=c\\cdot\\frac{{@5}}{{@6}}=1$, teda $c={@7}$.": "$\\int_0^{{@0}}c\\,{@1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x=c\\left[\\frac{x^{{@2}}}{{@3}}\\right]_0^{{@4}}=c\\cdot\\frac{{@5}}{{@6}}=1$이므로 $c={@7}$예요.",
