  "$n={@0}$, $\\bar{x}=\\frac{{@1}}{{@2}}={@3}$. $\\sum x_i^2={@4}$, teda $\\sum(x_i-\\bar{x})^2=\\sum x_i^2-n\\bar{x}^2={@5}$. $s^2=\\frac{{@6}}{{@7}}{@8}{@9}${@10}.": "$n={@0}$, $\\bar{x}=\\frac{{@1}}{{@2}}={@3}$. $\\sum x_i^2={@4}$이므로 $\\sum(x_i-\\bar{x})^2=\\sum x_i^2-n\\bar{x}^2={@5}$. $s^2=\\frac{{@6}}{{@7}}{@8}{@9}${@10}.",
